{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 18, :comments ["<b>And before</b> Three times in the Masorah: here, and the others: ובטרם יתנגפו רגליכם, ובטרם תצא מרחם. Because of this sin the exiles rolled upon them and their feet were struck. And 'before coming forth from the womb' — as stated in the Midrash, that Joseph was born circumcised."], :book :genesis, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 37, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Kitzur Baal HaTurim" "http://sefaria.org"] ["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:17:53.328489728Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}